\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px\"><div \nstyle=\"color:#222;direction:ltr;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;mso-line-height-alt:21px\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><em>Was this email forwarded to you?</em> <a href=\"https://lien.invalid/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #226cec;\" rel=\"noopener\">Sign up here.</a></p></div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><table class=\"row row-6\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"row-content stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;background-color:#f8f8f8;border-left:2px solid navy;border-radius:0;border-right:2px solid navy;color:#000;width:650px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"650\">\n<tbody><tr><td class=\"column column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tr><td class=\"col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px\"><table class=\"divider_block block-1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" \nstyle=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px\" align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tr><td class=\"divider_inner\" style=\"font-size:1px;line-height:1px;border-top:3px solid #000\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word;\">&#8202;</span></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody>\n</table><table class=\"row row-7\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"row-content stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;background-color:#f8f8f8;border-left:2px solid navy;border-radius:0;border-right:2px solid navy;color:#000;width:650px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"650\"><tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"column column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tr><td class=\"col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px\"><table class=\"heading_block block-1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" \nstyle=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"width:100%;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px\" align=\"center\"><h1 style=\"margin:0;color:#222;direction:ltr;font-family:Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;mso-line-height-alt:35px\"><span class=\"tinyMce-placeholder\" style=\"word-break: break-word;\">Midterms Impact on Defense Budgets</span></h1></td></tr>\n</table><table class=\"image_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"width:100%\" align=\"center\"><div style=\"max-width:646px\"><img src=\"https://lien.invalid/\" style=\"display:block;height:auto;border:0;width:100%\" width=\"646\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" height=\"auto\"></div></td></tr></table>\n<table class=\"paragraph_block block-3\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px\"><div style=\"color:#222;direction:ltr;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:21px\"><p \nstyle=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:24px\">Democrats took Congress, in convincing fashion.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:24px\">So, what does that mean for space and defense spending?&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:24px\">We dug through the last 30 years of defense budgets and party control changes for clues about what could come next.</p><p style=\"margin:0\">\n<strong>The quick takeaway: </strong>A Democratic Congress will likely dampen defense budget growth, particularly Trump's $1.5T goal, and certainly slow momentum for Golden Dome. But history suggests it does not mean major defense spending cuts are on the horizon.<br><br>\n<strong>A look at history:</strong> The last time Democrats gained full control or split Congress under a Republican president was in 2018 when Donald Trump was president. Defense funding grew 2.5% after inflation in the first full budget cycle. The last time the Democrats took both chambers under a Republican White House was in the George W. Bush years. Defense funding grew 9% that year.<br><br>\nPlus, defense funding increased in the first full budget cycle after six of the seven midterms shown. We dive into the numbers, trends, and predictions.&nbsp;</p></div></td></tr></table><table class=\"paragraph_